WEBVTT

00:13:59.083 --> 00:14:01.434
and he would look at me
very indulgently and say,

00:14:01.458 --> 00:14:03.601
"Son, now I have a Mastercard
because of you,

00:14:03.625 --> 00:14:05.684
but could you please go away"
kind of thing.

00:14:05.708 --> 00:14:06.976
And I understand that.

00:14:07.000 --> 00:14:10.768
And I think you've got to deal
with therefore "cashless,"

00:14:10.792 --> 00:14:12.101
in inverted commas.

00:14:12.125 --> 00:14:14.643
Reducing cash in the economy

00:14:14.667 --> 00:14:16.768
is to me a good objective.

00:14:16.792 --> 00:14:18.309
Taking it to zero?

00:14:18.333 --> 00:14:19.809
I'm not there.

00:14:19.833 --> 00:14:22.601
Why do I say it's a good
objective to reduce it?

00:14:22.625 --> 00:14:26.893
Because cash actually is the friend

00:14:26.917 --> 00:14:30.559
of the person who has something to hide.